" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Inactive</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"340.0\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">it lands</text><line class=\"f-arr\" x1=\"401\" y1=\"61\" x2=\"409\" y2=\"61\" marker-end=\"url(#f-fl3)\"/><rect class=\"f-phase\" x=\"410\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"470.0\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Board</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"470.0\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Action + Noise</text><line class=\"f-arr\" x1=\"531\" y1=\"61\" x2=\"539\" y2=\"61\" marker-end=\"url(#f-fl3)\"/><rect class=\"f-phase\" x=\"540\" y=\"34\" width=\"120\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"53\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Launch</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"600.0\" y=\"72\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Event Phase</text><line class=\"f-arr\" x1=\"210\" y1=\"90\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"108\" marker-end=\"url(#f-fl3)\"/><rect class=\"f-box\" x=\"150\" y=\"112\" width=\"120\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"210.0\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Active</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"210.0\" y=\"150\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Lander shot down</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"300\" y=\"139\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Life Support Control B lets you see the AA tokens.</text><text class=\"fth\" x=\"20\" y=\"196\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">The other ways out</text><rect class=\"f-phase\" x=\"20\" y=\"212\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Escape Shuttle</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"120.0\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Noise · one seat only</text><rect class=\"f-phase\" x=\"240\" y=\"212\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"340.0\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Hibernatorium</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"340.0\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Noise · if turned on</text><rect class=\"f-box\" x=\"460\" y=\"212\" width=\"200\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\"/><text class=\"fth\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"231\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Autodestruction</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"560.0\" y=\"250\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">everyone inside dies</text><text class=\"fts\" x=\"340\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" dominant-baseline=\"central\">Hibernating is not escaping: if the Facility is destroyed, hibernating Characters die.</text></svg>",
